  "pli-tv-bu-vb-pc3:1.20.1": "This is translated somewhat freely in accordance with the explanation below and in the commentary. According to <a href='https://suttacentral.net/pli-tv-bu-vb-pc3/en/brahmali#2.3.1'>Bu Pc 3:2.3.1</a> the offense is only incurred when a monk brings the words of another monk to the attention of yet another monk, and thus the translation “between monks”. Sp 2.37 supports the plural rendering “monks”: <i lang='pi' translate='no'>Bhikkhūnaṁ pesuññe</i>, “Malicious talebearing of monks”. ",
