  "pli-tv-bu-vb-pc3:2.2.24": "I have added the ellipses points, which are presumably missing in the Pali due to an editing mistake, cf. <a href='https://suttacentral.net/pli-tv-bu-vb-pc3/en/brahmali#2.2.22'>Bu Pc 3:2.2.22</a>. The ellipses points are also missing at <a href='https://suttacentral.net/pli-tv-bu-vb-pc3/en/brahmali#2.2.26'>Bu Pc 3:2.2.26</a>. ",
  "pli-tv-bu-vb-pc3:2.2.25": "",
  "pli-tv-bu-vb-pc3:2.2.26": "",
  "pli-tv-bu-vb-pc3:2.2.27": "This looks like an editing mistake. Presumably this should read, “We’re not going to a good destination/we can only expect a bad destination.” ",
